WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:15.682 --> 00:00:16.850
My God.

00:00:19.144 --> 00:00:20.770
You're go for Castle Bravo!

00:00:20.854 --> 00:00:22.564
Attention! Attention!

00:00:22.647 --> 00:00:26.026
Transmitting detonation signal
to Castle Bravo in 30 seconds!

00:00:34.784 --> 00:00:41.249
Ten, nine, eight, seven, six…

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:45.795
- Let me go! Let me go!
- Kei. It's over.

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:46.880
I have to stop it!

00:00:46.963 --> 00:00:48.298
Stop!!

00:00:48.381 --> 00:00:50.550
- …two, one.
- Please don't do it!

00:00:50.633 --> 00:00:51.676
You can't do this!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:52.469
Please!

